-- Seed file for kb_retrogrades
-- Natal retrograde interpretations for each planet
-- (Sun and Moon never go retrograde)

INSERT INTO kb_retrogrades (planet, summary, life_patterns, growth) VALUES

('Mercury',
 'Mercury retrograde in your birth chart means your mind works differently. You process information internally before speaking. You''re a deep thinker, not a fast talker. People may underestimate your intelligence because you don''t perform it on demand.',
 'You revise constantly—emails, conversations, decisions. You think of the perfect thing to say after the moment has passed. You''re drawn to revisiting old ideas, places, and people. Learning comes in cycles, not straight lines.',
 'Trust your internal processing speed. Your mind is thorough, not slow. Journaling helps you access what you know. You often understand things better the second time around—that''s a feature, not a bug.'),

('Venus',
 'Venus retrograde in your birth chart means love doesn''t follow the standard script. You may attract unusual relationship timelines—late bloomers, reconnecting with exes, or unconventional partnerships. Your values around love were set early and run deep.',
 'You question what you''re attracted to. Past relationships keep coming back—literally or in patterns. You may struggle to feel worthy of love or have expensive taste that conflicts with your budget. You love intensely but privately.',
 'Stop comparing your love life to anyone else''s timeline. Your relationships are rich and meaningful precisely because you don''t take them lightly. The love that works for you may look nothing like what''s expected.'),

('Mars',
 'Mars retrograde in your birth chart means your drive and anger turn inward. You''re not passive—you''re strategic. But you may struggle to assert yourself directly or feel guilty about wanting things.',
 'You second-guess your impulses. You might suppress anger until it explodes or direct it at yourself. Competition feels uncomfortable even when you want to win. Your energy comes in bursts rather than a steady stream.',
 'Your power is in your patience and strategy, not brute force. Learn to express anger in real time instead of storing it. Physical exercise is essential—your body needs to move the energy your mind holds back.'),

('Jupiter',
 'Jupiter retrograde in your birth chart means your growth is internal. While others chase external success and expansion, your abundance comes from inner wisdom, philosophy, and personal meaning.',
 'You may not feel lucky in obvious ways. Opportunities come through reflection and inner work rather than networking or putting yourself out there. You question mainstream beliefs about success and happiness.',
 'Your faith and optimism are self-generated, not given to you by circumstances. That makes them more durable. You find abundance by going deeper, not wider. Your wisdom comes from experience, not books.'),

('Saturn',
 'Saturn retrograde in your birth chart means your relationship with authority and discipline is internalized. You hold yourself to impossibly high standards—often higher than anyone else would set for you.',
 'You''re your own harshest critic. External rules feel less important than the ones you impose on yourself. You may question authority but still crave structure. You fear failure not because of consequences but because of what it says about you.',
 'Ease up on yourself. The discipline you need is the discipline to rest, to be imperfect, and to forgive yourself. You already work harder than most people—the growth is believing that''s enough.'),

('Uranus',
 'Uranus retrograde in your birth chart means your rebellious energy turns inward. You''re unconventional in your thinking but may not show it outwardly. Your revolution is personal and quiet.',
 'You feel different from others but may hide it. Your desire for freedom conflicts with a need to fit in. Change happens internally long before it shows up in your life. You have original ideas you hesitate to share.',
 'Your uniqueness isn''t something to manage—it''s your contribution. The inner revolution eventually needs to come out. Share your weird ideas. They''re probably years ahead of everyone else''s.'),

('Neptune',
 'Neptune retrograde in your birth chart means your spiritual and creative energy is deeply internal. You''re more intuitive than you show. Your imagination is vivid but you may doubt it or keep it private.',
 'You question your intuition even when it''s right. You have rich inner worlds—daydreams, fantasies, spiritual experiences—that feel too strange to share. You may struggle with escapism or have a complicated relationship with substances.',
 'Your inner vision is a gift, not a delusion. Learn to trust what you feel even when you can''t prove it. Creative and spiritual practices help you channel Neptune constructively. Your imagination is a superpower when you stop apologizing for it.'),

('Pluto',
 'Pluto retrograde in your birth chart means your transformative power is internal. You process change deeply and privately. Your psychological insight is extraordinary but you may not realize how powerful it is.',
 'You transform yourself before you transform anything external. You may obsess over self-improvement or psychological understanding. Power dynamics play out internally—you give away power or hoard it in cycles.',
 'You don''t need a crisis to evolve—you can choose transformation consciously. Your ability to regenerate from within is remarkable. Stop waiting for external destruction to force change. You have the power to remake yourself at any time.');
